      <title>Testing migration</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Debian</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;As member of the Release Team, Luc will give a clearer look on how packages migrate to testing.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;He will cover testing migration criteria, blocking and hinting of packages into testing, transitions, freezing, do&amp;#39;s and don&amp;#39;ts for maintainers etc.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
